\f2\b \cf0 Chapter One - Surf\'92s Up -2 billion years before the Dawkins
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 Describes a collision between two super-giant black holes.
\f1 \

\f0 I wanted a \'93tsunami\'94 of gravity waves strike the earth, 2 billion years later, in a timely fashion that saves the day.
\f1 \

\f0 I probably won\'92t use it.
